"clustering on rolling upgrades y existing data migration for all embedded "
"Elasticsearch architechtures. Refer to the :ref:`Release Notes` for "
"additional informaiton."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/overview.rst:9
msgid "|morpheus| Packages"
msgstr "|morpheus| Packages"

