" is no longer supported as a Morpheus Appliance Host Operating System. "
"Any |morpheus| Appliance running on 14.04 must be upgraded to 16.04, "
"18.04, 20.04, 22.04 or 24.04 BEFORE upgrading to 4.2.1+. Upgrades on "
"14.04 will not succeed"
msgstr "4.2.1+: Appliance: OS: Ubuntu 14.04 has reached its end of life (EOL) and is no longer supported as a Morpheus Appliance Host Operating System. Any |morpheus| Appliance running on 14.04 must be upgraded to 16.04, 18.04, 20.04, 22.04 or 24.04 BEFORE upgrading to 4.2.1+. Upgrades on 14.04 will not succeed"

